  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Pro-Resilience  Timor-Leste - Strengthening Resilience in Communities Most Affected by Drought</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">1. Enhanced livelihood resilience of vulnerable farm families in drought-prone areas of Timor-Leste
2. Community-based disaster risk management (CBDRM) plans adopted by 21 high-risk drought-prone rural communities
3. Climate-smart agricultural (CSA) technologies practised by 2 880 resource-poor smallholder farm families on a sustained basis</narrative>
  </description>
